00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:11,129
gCaptain reports that the Panama Canal Authority has finished receiving documents from companies seeking to prequalify for its proposed Energy Corridor.

2
00:00:11,079 --> 00:00:17,682
The project would support fuel and energy transport near one of the world's key shipping routes.

3
00:00:17,682 --> 00:00:27,770
The next stage matters for carriers because canal capacity, energy logistics and trade reliability remain closely linked.

